/* Not On My Shift — English (source language)
   Keys match Support/Strings.swift.

   Two rules for every language:
   - No plural agreement. Pick wording that reads correctly for 1 and for 38.
   - Never glue a suffix onto a placeholder. Turkish vowel harmony breaks
     ("2 saatlik" is right, "3 günlik" is not). Keep it a separate word. */

